    "location": "The Pendry Hotel, Grand Ballroom",
    "track": "side session",
    "topic": "trade",
    "speakers": [],
    "description": "The U.S. Chamber of Commerce and BusinessEurope will convene senior business leaders for a high-level discussion on how the transatlantic partnership can drive economic growth, accelerate innovation, and strengthen resilience in an increasingly challenging global environment. The event will feature two panels, Partners in Innovation: Transatlantic Leadership in Next-Generation Technologies and Partners in Resilience: Advancing Transatlantic Supply Chains.",
    "allDay": false
  },
  {
