    "track": "side session",
    "topic": "trade",
    "speakers": [],
    "description": "As the United States hosts its first B20, the Indo-Pacific Showcase gathers executives, investors and policymakers from across the region around the four currents reshaping it: investment, technology, energy and supply-chain security, and human capital. Attendees will also get a first look at the Quad Business Forum, a new private-sector platform linking the United States, Japan, India and Australia.",
